    "hardConstraintPosture": "All Tier-3-only hard constraints on the FK fields (IsRequired, IsReadOnly) downgraded to false; AllowsNull set null (no source opinion). The FK edge itself is Tier-1 structural (parametric-child nesting), so IsForeignKey + RelatedIntegrationObjectID are retained.",
    "syncPosture": "SupportsWrite=false, SupportsIncrementalSync=false, no incremental watermark — these IOs demonstrate the sublist access-path pattern only.",
